aditions | The Ohio State University Marching and Athletic Bands","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Requires access to the applicable Ohio Stadium event.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"osu-victory-bell","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Victory Bell","title":"Listen for the Victory Bell","subtitle":"Southeast Tower, Ohio Stadium","notes":"After a Buckeye victory, listen across campus for the Ohio Stadium bell, rung by Alpha Phi Omega as part of the longstanding tradition.","short_summary":"A 2,420-pound bell rung after Buckeye victories since 1954.","evidence_claim":"University Archives says Alpha Phi Omega members have rung the Victory Bell after Buckeye victories since October 2, 1954.","source_url":"https://library.osu.edu/archives/faq","source_title":"Historic Ohio State: FAQ | Ohio State University Libraries","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The bell is rung by the designated student organization; observe from publicly accessible areas during event operations.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"osu-light-up-the-lake","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Light Up the Lake","title":"Gather for Light Up the Lake","subtitle":"Mirror Lake Hollow","notes":"Attend the annual Mirror Lake Hollow lighting ceremony to hear student performers, sing “Carmen Ohio,” and watch the seasonal lights switch on.","short_summary":"Ohio Staters, Inc.’s annual winter lighting ceremony at Mirror Lake Hollow.","evidence_claim":"Ohio Staters, Inc. describes Light Up the Lake as its signature tradition of hanging seasonal lights around Mirror Lake Hollow, with performances and “Carmen Ohio.”","source_url":"https://u.osu.edu/ohiostaters/stater-projects/recurring-projects/","source_title":"Recurring Projects | Ohio Staters, Inc.","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Annual scheduling varies; check Ohio State Student Activities for the current event listing.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"osu-homecoming-parade","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Ohio State Homecoming Parade","title":"Line Up for Homecoming","subtitle":"Ohio State campus parade route","notes":"Check the annual route, then watch student organizations, Brutus and the marching band move through the Homecoming Parade before its campus conclusion.","short_summary":"A longstanding annual Homecoming celebration featuring student organizations and spirit groups.","evidence_claim":"Ohio State Student Activities calls the Homecoming Parade one of the university’s oldest traditions.","source_url":"https://activities.osu.edu/programs/signature-events/signature-events/","source_title":"Signature Events and Operations | Ohio State Student Activities","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Annual date and route change; consult the current Student Activities event details.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"osu-buckeye-grove","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Buckeye Grove tree planting","title":"Visit the Buckeye Grove Dedications","subtitle":"Southwest corner of Ohio Stadium","notes":"Walk through Buckeye Grove and look for the trees honoring football All-Americans; the traditional planting is held in a spring-game pregame ceremony.","short_summary":"Since 1934, Ohio State has planted a buckeye tree for each football All-American.","evidence_claim":"Ohio State Student Activities states that a buckeye tree has been planted for each Ohio State All-American football player since 1934.","source_url":"https://activities.osu.edu/posts/documents/getinvolved-2021-web.pdf","source_title":"Get Involved at Ohio State | Office of Student Life","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2023-08-01","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The grove is at the southwest corner of Ohio Stadium; planting-ceremony details depend on the current spring-game schedule.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
